OL,3,CParents appear in court over death of
OL,4,Cone-year-old boy
OL,6,FA man and a woman charged over the
OL,7,Fdeath of their one-year-old son have
OL,8,Fmade their first appearance in court.
OL,10,FAdam Johnson, 26, and Kylie Smith, 25,
OL,11,Fof St Helens, Merseyside, are accused
OL,12,Fof causing or allowing the death of
OL,13,FMaero Johnson in August 2023.
OL,15,FThe defendants appeared at Liverpool
OL,16,FMagistrates' Court on Thursday 13
OL,17,FAugust where they did not enter any
OL,18,Fpleas as the case was adjourned until
OL,19,F10 September.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/3
