OL,3,CParents appear in court over death of
OL,4,Cone-year-old boy
OL,6,FBoth also face an allegation of child
OL,7,Fneglect.
OL,9,FSmith indicated "firm" not guilty
OL,10,Fpleas to the two counts she faces, the
OL,11,Fcourt heard.
OL,13,FJohnson is further charged with
OL,14,Fpossession of cannabis.
OL,16,FThe pair were granted unconditional
OL,17,Fbail ahead of a plea and trial
OL,18,Fpreparation hearing at Liverpool Crown
OL,19,FCourt on September 10.
